    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is a multiple of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>is the remainder when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is divided by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;is the remainder when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is divided by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>",
